{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "unitId": "chapter-when-others-look-to-you-v1-parts-part-3-harm-effectiveness-legitimacy-bridge-from-movement-to-lenses",
  "generationHash": "sha256:0ae85466ed0557cd0af38e687e8e30cc9922d5c577903493b029157e52f3f22e",
  "granularity": "segment-only",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "s0001",
      "text": "Bridge — From Movement to Lenses",
      "startMs": 0.0,
      "endMs": 2972.0,
      "charStart": 0,
      "charEnd": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "text": "Start with movement.",
      "startMs": 3483.0,
      "endMs": 4737.0,
      "charStart": 34,
      "charEnd": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "text": "Renewal, erosion, and circulation describe how influence moves.",
      "startMs": 4737.0,
      "endMs": 9566.0,
      "charStart": 54,
      "charEnd": 117
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "text": "Each can be open or captured.",
      "startMs": 10182.0,
      "endMs": 12074.0,
      "charStart": 119,
      "charEnd": 148
    },
    {
      "id": "s0005",
      "text": "Turn to what that movement produces.",
      "startMs": 12248.0,
      "endMs": 14698.0,
      "charStart": 150,
      "charEnd": 186
    },
    {
      "id": "s0006",
      "text": "Harm, effectiveness, and legitimacy are three lenses on what influence is producing.",
      "startMs": 14698.0,
      "endMs": 20491.0,
      "charStart": 186,
      "charEnd": 270
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "text": "Each lens shows something the others miss.",
      "startMs": 20491.0,
      "endMs": 23046.0,
      "charStart": 270,
      "charEnd": 312
    },
    {
      "id": "s0008",
      "text": "Together they complete the picture.",
      "startMs": 23580.0,
      "endMs": 25542.0,
      "charStart": 315,
      "charEnd": 350
    },
    {
      "id": "s0009",
      "text": "Say plainly what each lens emphasizes.",
      "startMs": 25820.0,
      "endMs": 28676.0,
      "charStart": 352,
      "charEnd": 390
    },
    {
      "id": "s0010",
      "text": "Harm is where cost lands when reach grows.",
      "startMs": 29001.0,
      "endMs": 31869.0,
      "charStart": 391,
      "charEnd": 433
    },
    {
      "id": "s0011",
      "text": "Effectiveness is what success borrows from and what it still protects.",
      "startMs": 32194.0,
      "endMs": 36409.0,
      "charStart": 434,
      "charEnd": 504
    },
    {
      "id": "s0012",
      "text": "Legitimacy is why people keep following—and what permission they keep extending over time.",
      "startMs": 36409.0,
      "endMs": 41912.0,
      "charStart": 504,
      "charEnd": 594
    },
    {
      "id": "s0013",
      "text": "Read the lenses as a set.",
      "startMs": 42365.0,
      "endMs": 44164.0,
      "charStart": 597,
      "charEnd": 622
    },
    {
      "id": "s0014",
      "text": "Where one blurs, another can still sharpen the read.",
      "startMs": 44489.0,
      "endMs": 48019.0,
      "charStart": 623,
      "charEnd": 675
    }
  ]
}
